# LOG RULES — eProcure Enterprise

## 1. FRAMEWORK — LOG4J2 DUY NHẤT

```java
// ✅ Luôn dùng Log4j2 — KHÔNG dùng SLF4J, Logback, System.out
import org.apache.logging.log4j.LogManager;
import org.apache.logging.log4j.Logger;

public class PurchaseRequestController {
    private static final Logger log = LogManager.getLogger(PurchaseRequestController.class);
}

// ❌ CẤM TUYỆT ĐỐI
import org.slf4j.LoggerFactory;          // ❌
import org.slf4j.Logger;                 // ❌
System.out.println("debug info");        // ❌
System.err.println("error");             // ❌
e.printStackTrace();                     // ❌
```

### pom.xml — Exclude Logback khỏi MỌI dependency
```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
    <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>
    <exclusions>
        <exclusion>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-logging</artifactId>  <!-- Loại bỏ Logback -->
        </exclusion>
    </exclusions>
</dependency>
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
    <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-log4j2</artifactId>           <!-- Thêm Log4j2 -->
</dependency>
```

