## 2. LOG LEVEL THEO LAYER

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Layer       │ Level   │ Format prefix    │ Nội dung                    │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  FILTER      │ INFO    │ [REQUEST]        │ method url ip | status ms   │
│              │         │ [RESPONSE]       │                             │
│  CONTROLLER  │ INFO    │ [CONTROLLER]     │ method endpoint | userId    │
│  USE CASE    │ INFO    │ [ACTION]         │ Start/Step/Complete         │
│  REPOSITORY  │ DEBUG   │ [REPO]           │ operation | id              │
│  CACHE       │ DEBUG   │ [CACHE]          │ hit/miss/put/evict | key    │
│  SECURITY    │ WARN    │ [TOKEN]          │ Invalid/Revoked failures    │
│              │ WARN    │ [APIKEY]         │ Missing/Invalid API key     │
│              │ WARN    │ [SECURITY]       │ Unauthorized attempts       │
│  AUDIT       │ INFO    │ [AUDIT]          │ actor | action | entity     │
│  EXCEPTION   │ WARN    │ [EXCEPTION][CODE]│ Business errors (4xx)       │
│              │ ERROR   │ [EXCEPTION][CODE]│ System errors (5xx)         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 3. LOG FORMAT CHUẨN THEO LAYER

### 3.1 FILTER / HTTP layer
```java
// Request log
log.info("[REQUEST] {} {} | ip={} | agent={}",
    request.getMethod(), request.getRequestURI(),
    request.getRemoteAddr(), request.getHeader("User-Agent"));

// Response log (sau khi xử lý)
log.info("[RESPONSE] {} {} | status={} | duration={}ms",
    request.getMethod(), request.getRequestURI(),
    response.getStatus(), elapsedMs);
```

### 3.2 CONTROLLER layer
```java
// Log khi vào method — không log parameter nhạy cảm
log.info("[CONTROLLER] POST /purchase-requests | userId={}", principal.getMaskedId());
log.info("[CONTROLLER] GET /purchase-requests/{} | userId={}", prNumber, principal.getMaskedId());
```

### 3.3 USE CASE / APPLICATION layer
```java
// ✅ Start - Step - Complete pattern
log.info("[ACTION] Start CreatePR | userId={}", LogMaskingUtil.maskId(userId));
log.info("[ACTION] Step budget-check | prId={} | available={}", prId, availableAmount);
log.info("[ACTION] Step inventory-check | prId={} | itemCount={}", prId, itemCount);
log.info("[ACTION] Complete CreatePR | prNumber={} | totalAmount={}", prNumber, totalAmount);

// ✅ Sự kiện quan trọng
log.info("[ACTION] PR submitted to approval | prNumber={} | approver={}",
    prNumber, LogMaskingUtil.maskId(approverId));
log.info("[ACTION] PR approved | prNumber={} | by={}", prNumber, LogMaskingUtil.maskId(actorId));
```

### 3.4 REPOSITORY layer
```java
log.debug("[REPO] insert purchase_request | id={}", id);
log.debug("[REPO] findById | id={} | found={}", id, entity.isPresent());
log.debug("[REPO] findByFilter | filter={} | resultCount={}", filterSummary, count);
log.debug("[REPO] softDelete | id={} | deletedBy={}", id, LogMaskingUtil.maskId(deletedBy));
```

### 3.5 CACHE layer
```java
log.debug("[CACHE] hit | key=session:{}", tokenPrefix);
log.debug("[CACHE] miss | key=role-perm:{}", roleCode);
log.debug("[CACHE] put | key=budget:{}:{} | ttl={}min", deptId, year, ttlMinutes);
log.debug("[CACHE] evict | key=user-perm:{}", LogMaskingUtil.maskId(userId));
```

### 3.6 SECURITY layer
```java
// Token issues
log.warn("[TOKEN] Invalid token attempt | ip={} | path={}", ip, path);
log.warn("[TOKEN] Revoked token used | userId={} | ip={}", LogMaskingUtil.maskId(userId), ip);
log.warn("[TOKEN] Expired session detected | userId={}", LogMaskingUtil.maskId(userId));

// API Key issues
log.warn("[APIKEY] Missing X-Api-Key | service={} | ip={}", serviceName, ip);
log.warn("[APIKEY] Invalid X-Api-Key | ip={} | path={}", ip, path);

// Authorization failures
log.warn("[SECURITY] Unauthorized access | userId={} | permission={} | path={}",
    LogMaskingUtil.maskId(userId), requiredPermission, path);
log.warn("[SECURITY] Login failed | email={} | ip={} | attempt={}",
    LogMaskingUtil.maskEmail(email), ip, attemptCount);
log.warn("[SECURITY] Account locked | userId={} | ip={}", LogMaskingUtil.maskId(userId), ip);
```

### 3.7 AUDIT layer (file riêng, append-only)
```java
// Luôn dùng auditLog logger (route đến file audit.log riêng)
private static final Logger auditLog = LogManager.getLogger("com.eprocure.audit");

auditLog.info("[AUDIT] {} | actor={} | role={} | entity={}/{} | result={} | ip={}",
    action,                      // PR.SUBMITTED, APPROVAL.APPROVED, LOGIN.SUCCESS
    LogMaskingUtil.maskId(actorId),
    actorRoles,
    entityType, entityId,
    isSuccess ? "SUCCESS" : "FAILED",
    ip);
```

### 3.8 EXCEPTION layer
```java
// Business exception (WARN) — lỗi client, đã xử lý
log.warn("[EXCEPTION][{}] {} | userId={}", errorCode, message, LogMaskingUtil.maskId(userId));

// System exception (ERROR) — lỗi hệ thống, cần điều tra
log.error("[EXCEPTION][{}] Unexpected error | path={} | userId={}",
    errorCode, path, LogMaskingUtil.maskId(userId), exception);
// ↑ Truyền exception là argument cuối → Log4j2 tự in stack trace
```

